   "widgets_values": [
    "DEFINE art test, round 5: evenly spaced 8-stage ladder\n\nPress Run once: 8 images.\n\nOnly the two extremes are written as text. Stages in between blend the two encodings: m00 = fully scrawny, m100 = fully muscular.\n\nRows: physique sentence in English (EN) / Chinese (ZH).\n\nCheck: even steps between stages? Pose/costume/face steady?"
   ]
